{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在上半屏左侧的三行大字，尤其是绿色放大的“舒服地待在亲近里”和“暂时哪里也不去”；随后容易被下方另一块大字中放大的“有多喜欢”“是否一样”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"两个人正处于亲近相处的当下，他暂时不想考虑以后，只想停留在这种亲近里。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、自在、安静、放松。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他其实很喜欢对方，也想确认对方是否有同样的感情，但因为不知道怎么开口，最终没有说出来。上下两块文字之间的情感关系，第一眼不容易建立。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方主句较长，一块里包含不考虑未来、享受亲近、沉默自在、心慢慢漂开等多个层次。\",\n    \"上下两块大字都很显眼，下方的“有多喜欢”“是否一样”也有明显字号强调，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块里：上方呈现当下亲近自在的状态，下方才交代喜欢、想确认心意却没有开口的原因，需要拼接才能理解完整处境与感受的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "54ffc41a-922a-4b02-8f6b-397830b54772", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021254879582Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:13:32.742654+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5ded75bda680128d72fcac87d52a05776510ff8cce8e92f15636b3ffe8f731ac", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py":